{"id":"552b26d6fef18e07","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-mahlo.md","title":"Mahlo Cardinal","display":"df-mahlo — Mahlo Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mahlo","aliases":["58-df-mahlo"],"display":"df-mahlo — Mahlo Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mahlo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mahlo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mahlo — Mahlo Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mahlo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mahlo}\\)</span> (defined here; Mahlo cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\\)</span> (inaccessible-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mahlo}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{Reg}(\\lambda)\\},\\kappa)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mahlo}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{Reg}(\\lambda)\\},\\kappa)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Mahlo cardinal is a regular cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> such that the set of regular cardinals below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is stationary in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every Mahlo cardinal is inaccessible.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S$ (inaccessible-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Reg}$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}$ (stationary-set predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mahlo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mahlo}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{Reg}(\\lambda)\\},\\kappa)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e2ea98a4cc8e9ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mahlo}$ (Mahlo-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-mahlo]])"},{"id":"a08f2f109051a659","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)$ is the canonical predicate requiring strong inaccessibility and stationarily many regular cardinals (see [[58-df-mahlo]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-809","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-mahlo.md|58-df-mahlo]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["06ee5d7ff126e916","d83de8696e4dad26","b802c3dd76418d95"]}